      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Ya?”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Ini dah macam flow chart kilang.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Rizal tersenyum."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Memang.”"
