    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Apa?”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Kalau kita nak buat duit, kita tetap kena urus macam perniagaan.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Adam diam."
